   "id": "T-C",
   "spec": "SIM_DESIGN §3.5, §5.7, §5.8; §14 P5",
   "question": "Choose the completion weight w and decide the regime-dependent covariance on validation; score the completion of unstated factors once on the test; gate: where the model cannot infer, it stays near unconditional.",
   "implementation": "scenariolab.qmodel.factor_checks.tc(Q, P, seed, n) (P3; the stack as of P4b), called once by this runner on the monthly panel P and the quarterly panel Q; qmodel.json's stored T_C is not read for the decision",
   "validation": {
    "origins": "1995Q1..2014Q4 (80 quarters)",
    "refits": "yearly, each January on data to the previous December (fit at (year-1)Q4, anchors fitted to the train end, §5.5)"
   },
   "test": {
    "fit_end": "2014Q4",
    "origins": "2015Q1..2026Q3 (47 quarters)"
   },
   "mode": "step mode (H = 1): the Gaussian conditional moments of the quarter given the origin's state and the stated fields (factors.conditional_moments), n draws",
   "patterns": {
    "a": "a random 50% of the factor layer's x fields stated (rng([seed, year, quarter]))",
    "b": "only the E0 and E0p fields stated (narrative-like)",
    "c": "only the financial-conditions fields stated (card fc_role required_one or optional)"
   },
   "stated_values": "the realized values, saturated at +-4 sd as the model does; d_ff is not stated in zero-bound quarters (the shadow rate is not observed at the floor)",
   "metrics": "per unstated field: completion R² against the model's unconditional (state-only) prediction, CRPS, 80% coverage (10-90% of the draws)",
   "w_grid": [
    0.0,
    0.25,
    0.5,
    0.75,
    1.0
   ],
   "selection_w": "w* = argmin over the grid of the mean CRPS relative to the unconditional CRPS, pattern (b), E1 / E1c / E2 fields, pooled covariance, validation origins",
   "regime_cov": {
    "n0": 40,
    "regimes": "s_zlb, s_core4",
    "adopt_if": "at w*, pattern (b): the E1-class mean relative CRPS in ZLB quarters is lower with the regime covariance than without, and its change in every other cell (pattern a, c, and b outside the ZLB; ZLB and normal quarters) is at most +0.01"
   },
   "gate": "pattern (b) on the test: every E1-class field's completion R² >= -0.02",
   "seed": 20261102,
   "draws": 1000,
   "application": "This run records T-C's selection and gate. It does not change config_q.COMPLETION_W or REGIME_COV: path mode (qmodel.factors.simulate) would follow them while step mode (qmodel.rollout.Stepper) implements neither, so switching them breaks the step / path consistency of §3.7. The lead decides after the run (implement both in step mode, then set the defaults to the selection).",
   "disclosure": [
    "T-C was computed twice in development before this record, with the same code path and seed (P3; P4b, stored in data/results/qmodel.json at 2026-11-02 07:11: w* 0.25, regime covariance not adopted, gate failed with d_tp10 at -0.029). The protocol and its implementation were therefore seen with results; this is the pre-registered execution, expected to reproduce P4b's numbers.",
    "The test decade 2015-26 has been seen by earlier rounds (§4.2 disclosure)."
   ],
   "interpretations": [
    "'E1 field' in the gate = card endogeneity class E1 (financial markets); the w selection uses E1, E1c and E2 (the classes §3.5 shrinks).",
    "Completion is scored in step mode (one quarter), as the implementation does."
   ]
